## Summary of Session A Fixes

All P0, P1, and select P2 fixes have been successfully implemented and verified to compile. Here's what was completed:

### P0 — Critical Blocking Bugs (6 fixes)

**P0-1: F during ritual re-entrancy** - Added guard in `tryRaiseGrave()` checking if ritual/overlay is active; reset all ritual instance fields in `init()`.

**P0-2: Wizard sliding during ritual & stuck keys** - Stop wizard velocity and play idle in `tryRaiseGrave()`; call `resetKeys()` in `ritualFullyEnded` handler.

**P0-3: Plaque/hint not reappearing after ritual** - Reset `lastProxGraveId = null` in `ritualFullyEnded` to re-trigger proximity checks.

**P0-4: Hint showing faintly behind subtitles** - Added `hide(immediate)` method to ProximityHint; call with `true` during ritual/overlay; track and kill fade tweens.

**P0-5: Mobile joystick off-screen & wrong speed** - Moved Joystick to UIScene (zoom 1, not affected by camera), normalized force from pixels to [-1,1], hid during ritual/overlay, exposed force to GraveyardWorld via type-safe accessor.

**P0-6: Game cropping on phones** - Changed `#game-container` to `100vw / 100dvh`; added `touch-action: none` on html/body.

### P1 — Pre-Demo Fixes (11 fixes)

**P1-1: Farewell voice never plays** - Use `this.cache.audio.exists()` instead of `this.sound.get()`.

**P1-2: Listener & resource leaks** - Destroyed voiceSound and emitters; dropped rip-exit listener, used onExit callback instead; tracked subtitle tweens in arrays; hid UI elements immediately on cancel.

**P1-3: Credits pauses only UIScene** - Pause GraveyardWorld too; resume both in goBack(); reset keys.

**P1-4: Credits button starts game** - Check `!scene.isActive('CreditsScene')` in input handler.

**P1-5: Title music never heard** - Two-step entry: first click plays waltz (faded in), second click enters graveyard.

**P1-6: Plaque text overlaps frame** - Increased `PADDING_TOP` to 66, `PADDING_SIDE` to 68, `PANEL_H` to 230.

**P1-7: Dust cloud hides wizard** - Reduced scale (0.18→0.05), alpha (0.45), added upward angle fan and `speedY: -30`, lowered depth to 22.

**P1-8: Fonts render as fallback** - Explicitly load fonts with `Promise.race()` and 2.5s timeout before Phaser init.

**P1-16: Ritual FX drift off stone** - Apply shake to ResurrectionRitual camera in same `onUpdate` as GraveyardWorld.

**P1-17: Chant drone under overlay** - Fade `chantLoop` volume to 0 in `openOverlay()` over 800ms.

**P1-18: AudioManager tween stacking & mute** - Call `killTweensOf()` before new fade tweens; read & apply saved mute state from localStorage on UIScene/TitleScene create.

### P2 — Polish (2 fixes)

**P2-1: window.__RD exposed in production** - Guard behind `import.meta.env.DEV || params.has('debug')`.

**P2-17: Hint text for touch devices** - Added `setText()` to ProximityHint; show "Tap F..." when joystick active.

